{
  "$comment": [
    "The shape of X's DOM that Aviary depends on, recorded as data instead of as a saved page.",
    "",
    "Every selector in this repository used to be proved against two authenticated captures. That",
    "made the captures the authority, and an authority that carries a real account's handle, display",
    "name, post text and media URLs cannot be published, while one that ages cannot be kept. The",
    "schema below is the part the tests actually needed: which test ids exist, how they nest, which",
    "roles and aria attributes carry them, and how many of each a route renders. tools/fixture-",
    "generator.mjs turns it into deterministic synthetic Home and conversation documents with no real",
    "identity in them.",
    "",
    "derivedFrom.capturedOn is the date the observation was made, not the date the schema was",
    "written. Regenerating markup does not make the observation newer, so preflight ages this field",
    "exactly the way it aged the captures. A refreshed capture updates this file and is then thrown",
    "away."
  ],
  "ceilingDays": 90,
  "warnDays": 30,
  "acknowledgedStaleUntil": "2026-09-30",
  "acknowledgedReason": "Refreshing the observation requires an authenticated save-as-MHTML that only the operator can produce; tracked in Roadmap_Blocked.md. Generating fresh markup from this schema does not make the observation newer, so the waiver still expires and the gate still returns.",
